[{"op":"set","variable":30001,"value":1920},{"op":"set","variable":30002,"value":1080},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i413"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"时光飞逝。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"转眼间就来到了暑假的最后一天。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"也就是我要回去的日子。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"终于到了这一天。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"令我吃惊的是，岛上的人们都来到港口为我送行。"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i2"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“那个……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"到场的人实在太多，都让我怀疑岛上的人是不是真的‘都’来了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"仅仅是为了送我。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"这场面让我不禁感到震撼。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"对于我这个暑假过到一半就想要回家……想要逃离这座岛的人而言，这实在是一幅太过奢侈的景象。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“真的承蒙各位照顾了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"岛上的大人C","text":"“啥？听不见！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“哎？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12144"},{"op":"text","speaker":"良一","text":"“人太多了，后面的人好像听不到啊。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“真的假的……”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i15011"},{"op":"text","speaker":"天善","text":"“鹰原，这是最后一刻了，你就放开嗓子喊吧。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"听到天善这句话，少年团的大家都笑着点了点头。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“呃，那就……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“呼～……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":" “真的非常感谢大家的照顾!!” "},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我使出浑身的力气大喊出来。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"让这座岛上所有的人……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"不，也包括这座岛本身，都能听到我发自内心的呐喊。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"不需要什么冗长的致辞。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"这一句话，就足以概括我在这座岛上经历的一切。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10168"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“啊，吓我一跳。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i11712"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“嗓、嗓门大也该有个限度吧。”"},{"op":"image","layer":513,"image":"i15782"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“差点以为鼓膜都要震破了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“嘿嘿，游泳部的肺活量不是盖的吧。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"这样的话，我的心意一定能传达到吧。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"传达给岛上的每一个人。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"也传达给这座岛本身。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10361"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“但是，你真的要走了呢。”"},{"op":"image","layer":513,"image":"i15798"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“怎么，舍不得了？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10330"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“才没有呢。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……咦？白羽呢？”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i11721"},{"op":"image","layer":513,"image":"i15801"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“唔，明明都告诉过她船出发的时间了……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10308"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“她好像没来呢。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“是吗。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“我还想再跟她道一声谢呢。”"},{"op":"image","layer":769,"image":"i12144"},{"op":"text","speaker":"良一","text":"“反正你还会再来的吧。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15014"},{"op":"text","speaker":"天善","text":"“是啊，而且肯定很快就会来的。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“哈哈，或许吧。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i11696"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“下次应该是寒假吧。这里冬天的海鲜也是一绝哦。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“那我可一定要来尝尝啊。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15041"},{"op":"image","layer":769,"image":"i12162"},{"op":"text","speaker":"良一","text":"“嗯，一定要再来啊。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“嗯，一定。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我和少年团的大家相视而笑。他们和我度过了一段最为难忘的时光。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"总觉得有点不可思议。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"感觉我好像从很久以前就认识他们了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"所以，虽然寂寞却又不会太寂寞……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"因为我们很快就能再见面。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"因为知道我们还会再相见。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"就是这样的感觉。"},{"op":"image","layer":513,"image":"i11581"},{"op":"text","speaker":"镜子","text":"“羽依里，差不多快到时间了哦。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“啊，好的。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“那，羽未也……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"正当我转过身去，想要向羽未最后道个别的时候――"},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"clear","layer":257},{"op":"clear","layer":513},{"op":"clear","layer":769},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1786"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1785"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"一个小小的、温暖而又幸福的身影，从背后抱住了我。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我马上就知道了那是羽未。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“羽未，怎么了？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“…………”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"羽未紧紧地抱着我的腰。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"把脸埋在了我的腰间。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"那个地方因为羽未的呼吸和其他的什么东西，变得温暖而潮湿。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“…………”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我任由羽未紧紧地抱着我。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"虽然想对她说几句体贴的话，但却一句都想不出来。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"不过，我们就这样相依在一起，也仿佛交流了许许多多的心意。"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1787"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“……谢谢你……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"最后，羽未说出了这句话。"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1788"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“该说谢谢的是我才对。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“这个暑假真的好开心。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"羽未把脸埋在我的腰间，一个劲地点着头。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"背部又变得潮湿了。可能她是在哭吧。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“我还会再来的。”"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1789"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“嗯……嗯……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“那，我走了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“嗯……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“就稍微一小会儿……拜拜。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“嗯，就稍微一小会儿，拜拜。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"镜子","text":"“羽依里，船要出发了哦。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“好的，我这就去。”"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1790"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“羽未，抱歉。我差不多该走了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“……嗯。”"},{"op":"image","layer":2050,"image":"i187"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i187"},{"op":"clear","layer":2050},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i507"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"船开了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"港口和岛屿都渐渐离我远去。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“再见啦――――――――！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我从甲板的栏杆上用力探出身子，向为我送行的人们挥手。"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1792"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"羽未独自一人待在人群之外。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"她站在一个比其他人都要靠前的位置，来为我送行。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"她使劲用手按住帽子，以防被海风吹走。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"同时向我露出笑容。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"然后脸上带着那个笑容，指向了一个稍远的地方。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我把视线移了过去……"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1133"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“白羽……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“…………”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"虽然她什么都没说，但在看着我这边。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"她确实也来为我送行了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“白羽！谢谢你！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"大概她听到了我的声音，也向我轻轻挥了挥手。"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1791"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我又把视线转回羽未身上。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“羽未！再见！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“好的！再见……！”"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1793"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“我们夏天再见！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我们定下了再会的承诺。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"这个夏天，我在这座岛上得到的东西，是渺小却又无比夺目的。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我想，它们一定会在我心中永远闪耀着光芒。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“鹰原哥……！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"她直直地望着我。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"教会我这一切的那个少女。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"然后，她有些依依不舍地，微微眯起了眼睛。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“――啊，谢谢。”"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1794"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“哎……？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"风声遮盖了那句话，我没能听清。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我刚想问问她说了什么的时候……"},{"op":"image","layer":2050,"image":"i187"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i187"},{"op":"clear","layer":2050},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"又刮来了一阵风。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"被冰冷的海风刺痛双眼，我不由得一瞬间闭上了眼睛。"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1795"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"而当我再次睁开眼的时候，羽未已经不在港口了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"港口渐渐远去。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"连同那些无可替代的回忆一起。"},{"op":"image","layer":2050,"image":"i187"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i187"},{"op":"clear","layer":2050},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i154"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"船渐渐驶离小岛。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"驶离了那座为我留下了许多回忆，又让我回想起了许多宝贵事物的鸟白岛。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"驶离了那座明明是初次到访，却令我莫名怀念的小岛……"},{"op":"set","variable":3,"value":1},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"set","variable":483,"value":["neg",20]},{"op":"set","variable":482,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"set","variable":12019,"value":1},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"set","variable":23,"value":0},{"op":"set","variable":19,"value":0},{"op":"set","variable":20,"value":0},{"op":"set","variable":21,"value":0},{"op":"set","variable":7120,"value":0},{"op":"set","variable":3,"value":0},{"op":"return"},{"op":"end"}]